      "status": "editorial_pending",
      "text": {
        "en": "There are no permanent residents in Antarctica. Only scientists live there for research. The Pacific Ocean is the largest and the most geologically active ocean. Asia is the most populous continent. South America is the wettest continent."
      },
      "sourceBlockId": "source-l1-p18-residents-climate-population",
